ull of charismatic and unforgettable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking visual style that pays tribute to Japanese anime of the 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome soundtrack that will empower your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover all the secrets by replaying the levels and finding the hidden objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nya nya nya nya nyaaaaaaa (meow with a button).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332950/extras/a8b13b8d651bc705347fd722b65bcaff.poster.avif?t=1749585009\" width=556 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332950/extras/a8b13b8d651bc705347fd722b65bcaff.webm?t=1749585009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332950/extras/a8b13b8d651bc705347fd722b65bcaff.mp4?t=1749585009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the aliens decide to invade Earth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they capture all the humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What brought them here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the biggest question... A muscular cat?!</p>","developers":["Kamotachi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332950/header.jpg?t=1749585009","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Kamotachi. Publicado por: Mameshiba Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1332950/638056/d77b94236ef21aa5a71d5d33cb4197b81efb11e7/1751222734/dash_av1.mpd?